Microsoft Office 2016 September update was initially released for Office Insiders on 13th September 2016. According[ to] Microsoft, the update has 34 security updates (1 bulletin) and 35 non-security updates in it including desktop operating systems, servers, browsers, Exchange server, Silver[light], SMB[v]1 and several[ others. In addition,] it also rate 7 updates as critical and[ another 7 updates] as important[.
